<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to May 14, of 1996/97 shipments, export commitments and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p>(thousands of tonnes).........................1997/98..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  7,718.1  9,000.0   Dec-Nov	   30.7  9,021.0</p>
<p> Forrage wheat  135.5    200.0   Dec-Nov	    n/a    175.4</p>
<p> Maize	  4,291.2  5,900.0   Mar-Feb	    n/a  5,911.5</p>
<p> Sorghum	  231.7    300.0   Mar-Feb	    n/a    426.5</p>
<p> Soybeans	 267.0    500.0   Apr-Mar	    n/a  1,280.6</p>
<p> Sunseeds	   5.6     15.0   Jan-Dec	    n/a    115.0</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0655))</p>
